# Keep host build artifacts and VCS metadata out of the Docker build context.
# The monorepo Dockerfiles run `npm ci` + `tsc -b` from clean sources, so any
# pre-built node_modules/dist/.tsbuildinfo on the host (arm64 dev machine) must
# NOT leak into the linux image.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
.git
.github
**/*.log
**/.DS_Store
# Generated OPA policy bundle — rebuilt in-image via `npm run build:policy`.
**/policy.wasm
